          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Note to the Teacher:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Give more such examples that students can relate to and ask them to give reasons why they think they are correct. Engaging with these problems and finding solutions through a process of "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "proportional reasoning",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " should go along with learning procedures and methods to solve the problems."
            }
          ]
